  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be very helpful to be able to set the player \"pill\" (collider) to a custom spot on the body for fullbody tracking. For example, allowing it to be tied to the hip bone/tracker, rather than the head. That way if someone is in fullbody laying on a couch or something, if they need to lean to grab something, they don't end up falling off of the collider. Allowing the player to customize where they would like their \"pill\" placed/tied to would allow for a very simple QOL and comfort addition.",
